{
  "id": "6ad45afb0633090bb16772ad",
  "title": "コンタミネーション",
  "created": 1792301821,
  "updated": 1792310459,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6ad45afb0633090bb16772ad",
      "text": "コンタミネーション",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792301821,
      "updated": 1792301821
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad45b210000000000ec493d",
      "text": "汚染",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792301857,
      "updated": 1792301860
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad45afd0000000000ec493b",
      "text": " 実験区が雑菌などに汚染されること",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792301821,
      "updated": 1792302109
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad45afd0000000000ec493c",
      "text": "  [ブドウ球菌]の培地にアオカビのコンタミネーションが起こり、阻止円が観察される -> [ペニシリンを発見]へ",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792301822,
      "updated": 1792302082
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad45c1f0000000000ec4942",
      "text": " 隔離されるべき物質が隔離区の外に持ち出されること",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792302111,
      "updated": 1792302144
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad45c450000000000ec4944",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792302150,
      "updated": 1792302150
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad45c400000000000ec4943",
      "text": " [工場系ゲーム]で、アイテムが誤ったラインに流出し、生産に支障をきたすこと",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792302144,
      "updated": 1792302219
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad45b2d0000000000ec493f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1792301869,
      "updated": 1792301869
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad47c6800000000008040fb",
      "text": "機械系の分野でも同様に、本来入っているべきでないものが混入して汚染される際に使われる",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792310379,
      "updated": 1792310400
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad47c7d00000000008040fc",
      "text": "\tエンジンや作動油の分野では致命的な故障に繋がるため、コンタミを如何にして防ぐかは大事な要素となっている",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792310400,
      "updated": 1792310459
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad47c6700000000008040fa",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792310379,
      "updated": 1792310379
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad47bf500000000008040f8",
      "text": "略称　[コンタミ]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792310264,
      "updated": 1792310273
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad47bf500000000008040f9",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792310265,
      "updated": 1792310265
    }
  ]
}